(ʻOle = ʻOle) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['Nil is Nil!'].}.
(2 > 1) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['YES']. }.
(2 > 3) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['NO']. }.
(2 > 3) wahaheʻe: { Huapuka kākau: ['Nonono..'].}.
ʻOiaʻiʻo ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['TRUE is TRUE!']. }.
(ʻOiaʻiʻo) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['TRUE is TRUE!']. }.
Wahaheʻe wahaheʻe: { Huapuka kākau: ['FALSE is FALSE!']. }.
(Wahaheʻe) wahaheʻe: { Huapuka kākau: ['FALSE is FALSE!']. }.
